### Place an order
### Returns 201 Created with Location header. The transaction also writes outbox rows for
### the inventory listener and for RabbitMQ externalization.
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "alice@example.com",
  "productSku": "BOOK-1234",
  "quantity": 2,
  "totalAmount": 39.98
}

### Quick health probe
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
